@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FCE8E0
autonumber
participant "ReleasesPage / contentApi" as P0 <<boundary>>
participant "ContentVersionsController" as P1 <<controller>>
participant "ContentVersionService" as P2 <<service>>
participant "ContentVersionRepository" as P3 <<repository>>
participant "ContentVersion / ContentPublicationHistory" as P4 <<entity>>
note over P0,P4: Actor: Admin. A separate approval must precede publication.
P0 -> P1: Request publication
P1 -> P2: Check publication guards
P2 -> P3: Load version and snapshot
P3 --> P2: Return version snapshot
P2 -> P4: Read approval state
note over P2,P4: Require approval and current revision; recheck the validated snapshot.
alt all publication guards pass
P2 -> P3: Start publication
critical one advisory-locked database transaction
P3 -> P4: Activate release and add history
note over P3,P4: Archive the old release, activate the selected version and write history in one transaction.
end
P3 --> P2: Confirm publication
P2 --> P1: Return version details
P1 --> P0: Display the active release
else wrong state or stale revision
P2 --> P1: Report version conflict
P1 --> P0: Display the conflict
end
@enduml